    "description": "Kikuchi Seisakusho Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the metal products processing business in Japan, China, and internationally. The company offers prototype mold products and mass-produced products; robots and equipment for elderly care and industrial use, including wearable assist suits, drones, walking assistance robots, guidance robots, surgical robots, and motors; gamma camera measurement services; metal products; press and molding dies; plastic products; caregiving and welfare equipment; specialized industrial equipment; and business consulting. It also engages in the discovery of equipment development technology seeds; rental and leasing of robots and other intelligent machines; and research, development, manufacture, sales, installation, repair, rental, import, and export of medical devices and its parts. The company serves manufacturers of precision equipment, electrical equipment, and automotive parts. Kikuchi Seisakusho Co., Ltd. was founded in 1970 and is headquartered in Hachioji, Japan."
